<%- include('../partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50 text-gray-900 antialiased">
    <%- include('../partials/nav') %>
    <main class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <header class="mb-8">
        <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-red-500">The store</p>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">Home details</h1>
      </header>
      <section class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3 shadow-sm sm:gap-6 sm:p-4">
        <div class="min-h-60 overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
          <img
            src="<%= home.url %>"
            alt="Photo of <%= home.houseName %>"
            class="h-full min-h-60 w-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center divide-y divide-gray-100">
          <div class="py-3 first:pt-0">
            <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">Home</h2>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 sm:text-base"><%= home.houseName %></p>
          </div>
          <div class="py-3">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">Location</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600 sm:text-base"><%= home.location %></p>
          </div>
          <div class="py-3 last:pb-0">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">Price</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600 sm:text-base">
              $<%= home.price %> <span class="font-normal text-gray-500">/ night</span>
            </p>
            <br><br>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600 sm:text-base">
          

Welcome to Maple Haven, a warm and thoughtfully designed home tucked away in a quiet, tree-lined neighborhood, just minutes from the city center, local cafes, parks, and shops. From the moment you step inside, you will feel instantly at home. The bright, open-plan living area is filled with natural light, featuring a plush sofa, a large smart TV, a cozy reading corner, and large windows overlooking a private garden. It is the perfect place to relax after a long day of exploring, enjoy a movie night, or simply sip your morning coffee in peace.

The fully equipped kitchen is a dream for anyone who loves to cook, with modern appliances, ample counter space, fresh cookware, spices, and everything you need to prepare a proper meal. The dining table comfortably seats six guests, making it ideal for families, friends, or group travelers.

Upstairs, you will find three beautifully decorated bedrooms. The master bedroom offers a luxurious king-sized bed with soft, high-quality linens, blackout curtains, and an en-suite bathroom with a walk-in rainfall shower. The second bedroom has a comfortable queen bed, while the third offers two single beds, perfect for children or friends. All rooms include extra blankets, hangers, and plenty of storage space.

Outside, enjoy a spacious private patio with outdoor seating, a barbecue grill, string lights, and a peaceful garden where you can have breakfast in the fresh air or unwind in the evening.

Other amenities include fast Wi-Fi, air conditioning, heating, a washer and dryer, free private parking, a dedicated workspace, and a self-check-in system for complete flexibility and total peace of mind.

Whether you are here for a weekend getaway, a family vacation, a work trip, or a long relaxing stay, Maple Haven offers comfort, privacy, and convenience in one beautiful place. We take pride in keeping our home spotless, clean, and welcoming, and we are always just a message away if you need anything during your stay for you and your family. Book your stay today and experience a home that truly feels like your own.
            </p>
            
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
